        "TileImage": "$($repository ee27bfd3-e0a1-405e-a4f8-eb5f58ebfee3).Image",
        "Description": "Good afternoon, 47.\r\rWelcome to Whittleton Creek, where every lawn is immaculate, every neighbor is suspicious, and apparently everyone shares the same plastic surgeon.\r\rDifferent uniforms, different identities. Identical eyes, noses, and chins. Evidently, background checks in this neighborhood don&#39;t extend to the foreground. The residents call it a close-knit community.\r\rOur client calls it an identity crisis.\r\rTime to give the Neighborhood Watch something to watch, 47.\r\rGood hunting.",
